title: "The Hydra Cage: Disposable Trust and Regenerative Containment for Autonomous AI"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: kaymyg
repository-code: "https://github.com/kaymyg/hydra-cage"
